<title>SINGAPORE: ST Computer expects improved performance.</title>
<headline>ST Computer expects improved performance.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>ST Computer Systems and Services Ltd said on Tuesday it expected to improve its performance in 1997.  </p>
<p>The company said in a statement with its 1996 full-year financial results that it would continue to strengthen its regional operations.</p>
<p>It earlier reported a 16.5 percent fall in net profit for 1996 to Singapore $6.33 million.</p>
<p>&quot;Barring unforeseen circumstances, the directors expect the group to improve its performance in the current year,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
